10 REM! GOS

20 PRINT CHR$(147)
30 PT%=0 : PX%=20 : PY%=12 : AX%=0 : AY%=0
40 POKE 1024+PX%+PY%*40,81 : POKE 1024+AX%+AY%*40,42
50 TASYNC 1000 : TASYNC 1100 : GOTO 1200

1000 REM the player
1010 K%=PEEK(197):POKE 198,0:IF K%=64 THEN TYIELD:GOTO 1000
1020 OX%=PX%:OY%=PY%:PY%=PY%+(K%=9 AND PY%>0)-(K%=13 AND PY%<24):PX%=PX%+(K%=10 AND PX%>0)-(K%=18 AND PX%<39)
1030 TLOCK:POKE 1024+OX%+OY%*40,32:POKE 1024+PX%+PY%*40,81:TYIELD
1040 GOTO 1000

1100 REM the follower
1110 ZX%=AX%:ZY%=AY%:AX%=AX%-(PX%>AX%)+(PX%<AX%):AY%=AY%-(PY%>AY%)+(PY%<AY%)
1120 TLOCK:POKE 1024+ZX%+ZY%*40,32:POKE 1024+AX%+AY%*40,42:IF AX%=PX% AND AY%=PY% THEN PT%=PT%+1:PX%=RND(1)*40:PY%=RND(1)*25:POKE 1024+PX%+PY%*40,81
1130 TSLEEP 7
1140 GOTO 1100

1200 REM the score
1210 PRINT CHR$(19);TI;PT%
1220 TSLEEP 10
1230 GOTO 1200
